      "widgets_values": [
        "## Fish Audio Drama 3 - single speaker, no reference\n\nModel: `drama3_fp8experts_bf16.safetensors` (models/diffusion_models)\nCodec: `drama3_codec.safetensors` (models/vae)\n\nNo voice slots are connected. The model invents a voice for each seed; requeue with a new seed if a take falls silent. Text uses speaker 0 only. `one take per speaker` keeps one invented voice across the lines.\n\nSave prefix: `COMFY_WORKFLOWS/FISHDRAMA3_TTS_SOLO_NOREF`"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## Fish Audio Drama 3 - single speaker, no reference\n\nModel: `drama3_fp8experts_bf16.safetensors` (models/diffusion_models)\nCodec: `drama3_codec.safetensors` (models/vae)\n\nNo voice slots are connected. The model invents a voice for each seed; requeue with a new seed if a take falls silent. Text uses speaker 0 only. `one take per speaker` keeps one invented voice across the lines.\n\nSave prefix: `COMFY_WORKFLOWS/FISHDRAMA3_TTS_SOLO_NOREF`"
      },
